# An allowlist (Spec 006 section 6.4): nothing enters the build context unless a line below lets it
# in, so no jwicket.ini, lab token, key, receipt, evidence directory or stray file in build/ can
# reach an image layer. The last line that matches a path decides.
*
!Dockerfile
!entrypoint.py
!build/SHA256SUMS
!build/requirements-install.txt
!build/jwicket_install-*-py3-none-any.whl
